<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Car Sustainability Calculator</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial; margin:0; padding:0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1a3c, #0fae8f); color:white; }
header { text-align:center; padding:25px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
header h1 { color:#7CFCB3; }
.container { max-width:900px; margin:auto; padding:20px; }
.box { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding:20px; margin-bottom:25px; border-radius:12px; }
input, select, button { padding:10px; border-radius:6px; border:none; margin:5px 0; width:100%; font-size:1em; }
button { background:#198754; color:white; cursor:pointer; }
.result { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35); padding:15px; margin-top:15px; border-radius:10px; }
.red { color:#ff6b6b; } .yellow { color:#ffd43b; } .green { color:#69db7c; }
.index { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:15px; }
.index div { width:30%; text-align:center; padding:10px; border-radius:8px; }
footer { text-align:center; font-size:0.85em; opacity:0.8; padding:15px; }
.section-title { margin-top:20px; font-size:1.3em; border-bottom:1px solid #69db7c; padding-bottom:5px; }
img { width:100%; border-radius:10px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>Car Sustainability Calculator</h1>
<p>Daily Driving CO₂ Emissions Calculator</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
<div class="box">
<h2>Calculate Your Daily CO₂ Impact</h2>
<form method="POST">
<input type="text" name="brand" placeholder="Car brand & model" required>
<select name="fuel">
<option>Petrol</option>
<option>Diesel</option>
<option>Hybrid</option>
<option>Electric</option>
</select>
<input type="number" step="0.1" name="hours" placeholder="Hours driven per day" required>
<button type="submit">Calculate</button>
</form>

{% if result %}
<div class="result">
<p><strong>Vehicle:</strong> {{ result.brand }}</p>
<p><strong>Fuel:</strong> {{ result.fuel }}</p>
<p><strong>Hours Driven:</strong> {{ result.hours }} h/day</p>
<p><strong>Estimated Daily CO₂:</strong> {{ result.co2 }} g/day</p>
<p class="{{ result.color }}"><strong>Sustainability Score:</strong> {{ result.score }}/100</p>
<p class="{{ result.color }}">{{ result.explanation }}</p>
</div>
{% endif %}
</div>

<div class="box index">
<div class="red">1–49<br>High</div>
<div class="yellow">50–65<br>Moderate</div>
<div class="green">66–100<br>Low</div>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h3 class="section-title">CO₂ Emissions Explained</h3>
<p>CO₂ emissions are produced when carbon-based fuels are burned. More driving and fuel use increases your environmental impact. Petrol and diesel cars produce high CO₂, while hybrid and electric vehicles reduce emissions. Electric vehicles are cleaner on the road but consider battery production impacts as well.</p>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h3 class="section-title">Air Quality Map</h3>
<img src="https://image2url.com/r2/default/images/1770513541320-3b491b8a-db8f-48e4-9b60-3664bcd86cd9.png" alt="Air Quality Map">
</div>

<a href="/" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:20px;"><button style="background:#14532d;">Back to Home</button></a>
<footer>SustainX • Data-informed sustainability analysis</footer>
</body>
</html>

